{
    "version": "8.0.21",
    "description": "MySQL Community Server 8.0.21（锁定版本，不滚动最新）。与官方 'main' 仓库的 mysql manifest（追踪最新 8.x）形成对比。",
    "homepage": "https://dev.mysql.com/downloads/mysql/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
        "url": "https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html"
    },
    "notes": [
        "【版本锁定说明】",
        "本 manifest 已锁定到 8.0.21，无 autoupdate、无 checkver。",
        "即使本仓库后续推送其他 MySQL 版本 manifest（例如 mysql-8.0.30、mysql-5.7 等），",
        "本 manifest 文件不会被改动，始终可以安装到 MySQL 8.0.21。这是参照官方 versions 仓库的版本锁定模式。",
        "",
        "【首次启动配置（管理员 PowerShell）】",
        "  1) 初始化数据目录：",
        "       mysqld --initialize-insecure --console",
        "     （'insecure' 标志会创建一个无密码的 root@localhost 用户，便于首次配置）",
        "  2) 安装为 Windows 服务（可选，需管理员权限）：",
        "       mysqld --install MySQL",
        "  3) 启动服务：",
        "       net start MySQL",
        "  4) 设置 root 密码（强烈建议）：",
        "       mysql -u root -e \"ALTER USER 'root'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'your-password';\"",
        "",
        "【数据持久化】",
        "通过 'persist' 字段持久化 'data'、'log'、'my.ini' 路径，",
        "执行 'scoop update mysql-8.0.21' 升级时数据库不会丢失。",
        "",
        "【URL 提示】",
        "MySQL 的归档 URL 通常稳定，但偶有迁移。如果 8.0.21 下载链接返回 404，",
        "请到以下页面验证最新地址：",
        "  https://dev.mysql.com/downloads/mysql/",
        "  -> 'Archived versions' 链接",
        "",
        "【Hash 提示】",
        "本 manifest 故意省略 hash 字段。计算方法：",
        "  Get-FileHash mysql-8.0.21-winx64.zip -Algorithm SHA256",
        "或者安装时跳过校验：",
        "  scoop install cikaros/mysql-8.0.21 --skip"
    ],
    "url": "https://dev.mysql.com/get/Downloads/MySQL-8.0/mysql-8.0.21-winx64.zip",
    "extract_dir": "mysql-8.0.21-winx64",
    "env_set": {
        "MYSQL_HOME": "$dir"
    },
    "persist": [
        "data",
        "my.ini",
        "log"
    ],
    "bin": [
        "bin\\mysql.exe",
        "bin\\mysqld.exe",
        "bin\\mysqldump.exe",
        "bin\\mysqladmin.exe",
        "bin\\mysqlbinlog.exe",
        "bin\\mysql_config_editor.exe",
        "bin\\mysqlshow.exe",
        "bin\\mysqlslap.exe"
    ]
}
